# GRF name and description
STR_GRF_NAME	:British Rail Extra-zoom Train Set (BRETS)
STR_GRF_DESC    :{GOLD}British Rail Extra-zoom Train Set{}{BLACK}An extended length, 4x zoom, real livery train set.{}{}{GOLD}Developer: {LTBLUE}Su1phur{}{BLACK}Special Thanks to:{GOLD}Timberwolf{BLACK},{}{GOLD}GarlicBread42 and The GETS Team{BLACK},{}{GOLD}Audigex and The BRTrainsV2 Team{BLACK},{}{GOLD}andythenorth, Simozzz, Emperor Jake, 2TallTyler{BLACK} and the whole {RED}Discord{BLACK}-community.

